WEBVTT

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.760
Beyblade...

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.310
The world's most enjoyable battling top game!

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.310
The beys shot from their launchers,

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.360
and the Bladers' passions 
all collide in the stadium!

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.810
Beyblade Burst is...

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:28.430
...the story of the kids who do battle, 
entrusting their dreams to their Beys.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:34.010
This is our Beyblade Club!

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:37.700
Honcho, Daina, Kensuke, 
everyone is working really hard!

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:46.650
But we're still one person short, 
so we're still unofficial!

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:47.950
Ouch!

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:52.050
We're also doing Beybattle re-...research, I think?

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:56.010
Everyone's getting stronger thanks to it!

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.800
No sleeping!

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:03.970
Yeah, there! Get him!

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:06.720
Go, go, that's it, Valkyrie!

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:08.410
Yes!

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:16.160
And now the fourth round 
of the regionals is starting!

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.530
<i>Beyblade! Let's go</i>

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.530
<i>Beyblade! Hajimeyou</i>

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:33.000
<i>Become the ultimate Blader</i>

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:33.000
<i>mezasou ze, saikyou no blader</i>

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:38.580
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:38.580
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:43.460
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:43.460
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:47.720
<i>Yeah, everyone's got it</i>

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:47.720
<i>kitto, dare datte mottenda</i>

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:54.810
<i>The desire to win... and a Beyblade just for them!</i>

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:54.810
<i>kachitaitte kanjou to... kimi dake no beibureedo!</i>

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.730
<i>That's right, facing each other now</i>

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.730
<i>sou, mukiatta hyoujou ni</i>

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:04.860
<i>The will to become stronger starts boiling up, right?</i>

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:04.860
<i>tsuyoku naritaitte kimochi ga hora, uzumaitendarou?</i>

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:11.080
<i>Shoot! The throbbing of your spinning dreams (Burst!)</i>

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:11.080
<i>SHOOT! mawari dashita yume no kodou</i>

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:15.580
<i>Burn (Burst!) strong (Burst!), your hearts pound</i>

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:15.580
<i>atsuku hajike, takanariau</i>

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:17.790
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:17.790
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:20.500
<i>When two people (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:20.500
<i>zettai katsundatte iu</i>

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.800
<i>who've got the drive to win (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.800
<i>honki no omoi doushi ga</i>

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:24.800
<i>battle it out (Burst! Burst! Burst! Burst!)</i>

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:24.800
<i>butsukattara</i>

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:27.970
<i>bonds are formed (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:27.970
<i>kizuna ga umareru no sa</i>

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:30.640
<i>When it's time for the climax (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:30.640
<i>ketteiteki shunkan</i>

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:33.100
<i>face it off... together! (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:33.100
<i>oikakeyou... issho ni!</i>

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:38.390
<i>Can't stop, I'll finish this, with the! best! (Go!)</i>

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:38.390
<i>mou tomaranai, kimeru no sa  sai! kyou!</i>

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:42.110
<i>Burst Finish!</i>

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:42.110
<i>Baasuto Finisshu o!</i>

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:44.610
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:44.610
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:52.540
A Powerful Opponent! 
The Heavenly Horusood!!

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:57.200
The fourth round of the Beigoma Regionals Tournament...

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:59.110
...sponsored by the .wbba is about to begin!

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.430
I'm gonna win!

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:05.660
You look pumped.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.410
Sure am!

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:09.360
I am too.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:12.200
If you weren't, it wouldn't be fun!

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:14.900
You're almost up.

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:17.810
Could you go get in position?

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:18.850
-Okay!
-Sure!

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:25.500
Okay, boys and girls!

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:30.990
A-Block's first match, 
Hoji Konda versus Valt Aoi is coming up!

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:36.650
Bro!

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.000
Good luck!

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.340
You better win!

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:41.930
Yep! I've got this!

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:43.810
I'll do...

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.710
my best...

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:54.240
Okay! Victory Valkyrie versus 
Holy Horusood starts soon!

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.510
I won't let you down!

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:04.300
Over Finish and Spin Finish are both one point.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.580
A Burst Finish is two points.

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:09.120
First to two points wins.

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:14.710
Let's get wild, partner!

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:17.260
Let's go, Hoji!

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.720
Yeah! Bring it, Valt!

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:26.240
Valt Aoi swings his arm! He's in the spirit!

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:32.360
Hoji Konda is ready with his Long Winder as well!

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:35.820
Now what kind of battle will this be!?

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:37.900
I'm hyped already!

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.130
First Battle.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:46.910
Hoji's gonna use Horusood Field without a doubt.

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:52.750
A move that Burst Daina's 
Deathscyther has to be amazing.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:58.060
I can take it head-on.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:02.000
It makes me pumped just thinking about it!

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:05.310
What's he doing? He's laughing?

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:08.640
He tripped when he entered. 
He's not even focused.

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:11.390
Hoji will win this for sure.

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:17.840
Valt. I bet you don't even realize you're smiling.

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:21.920
I'm gonna wipe that smile right off your face!

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.570
Hoji changed his grip!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.690
What's different about it?

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:29.910
A forehand grip.

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:32.790
A grip focusing on control.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:36.000
Why's Hoji focusing so hard?

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:41.970
No need to be so cautious against 
a guy who won by pure luck.

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:44.430
Ready, set!

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:47.050
Three!

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:48.390
Two!

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:49.850
One!

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:51.980
Go Shoot!

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:57.310
Fly, Horusood!

00:05:57.840 --> 00:05:59.650
Its four wings spread!

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:03.860
It's just like a legendary bird flying in the sun!

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:06.660
And now it's in the center!

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:08.660
Take him on, Valkyrie!

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:14.920
It's Valkyrie's Rush Shoot attack!

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:18.250
Keep it up and Burst Horusood!

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:22.570
Valkyrie's Rush Shoot won't stop!

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:25.570
Attack!

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:26.820
Nice, Bro!

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:27.510
Wow!

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:32.610
Take on my Horusood Field.

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:45.490
Oh man! This is what Horusood Field's made of!

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:50.170
Valkyrie was hit, and now it's staggering...

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:53.300
It, it, it's stopped!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.830
This is Holy Horusood's power!

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:58.890
Holy Horusood, Spin Finish.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:00.790
Hoji Konda, one point!

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:01.920
Yes!

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:05.800
What're you doing, Valt!?

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:07.380
Big brother...

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:10.600
Horusood Field, huh? It's strong.

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:13.010
Hoji's really good.

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:16.890
That control-focused grip makes him even better.

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:23.610
So you're saying he's able to control 
that much power? What a guy!

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:29.880
When its stamina is drained, 
Rush Shoot ain't that big of a deal, is it?

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:31.850
Kyoji Aranami?

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:36.880
I'm honored the great Shu Kurenai 
remembered my name!

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:39.670
I remember my opponents' names.

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:42.610
That Valt guy's your best friend, right?

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:44.340
You should cheer for him.

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:45.440
Yeah.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.540
Although he's already lost.

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:51.720
You're better off worrying 
more about your own matches.

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:53.800
Right back at you.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:58.410
Hoji's done it! A one point lead!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:01.230
You think he'll win the next one as quickly?

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:04.130
Of course he'll win.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.590
The problem is how.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:08.350
Hoji!

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.120
What're ya doing!?

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:13.300
Burst him in one go already!

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:18.080
Hoji's the strongest, besides me.

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:22.900
Okay, Young Master. 
I'll end it with a Burst Finish!

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:24.600
Hoji!

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:28.380
Your Horusood Field is amazing!

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:32.260
I can't believe my Rush Shoot doesn't even work!

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:36.350
I've drove him into a corner, and yet still...?

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:39.140
But now it'll be different!

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:43.730
I'll win the second battle no matter what!

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:47.620
There he goes, smiling again! Did he give up?

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:50.150
Or maybe he's a pure-bred idiot?

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.700
Will Bro be alright?

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.410
Hey, Valt!

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:01.290
There's no time to goof around! Focus!

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:02.970
I am!

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:05.750
Now use your new move already!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.100
Yeah! Use the Flash Shoot!

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:10.010
Yeah, use it!

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:12.780
He's got a new move?

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:16.090
Yeah, but it's not completed yet, I think.

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:18.010
I'm looking forward to it!

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.270
Flash Shoot...

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.190
Will you use it, Valt?

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:25.560
Valt's new move...?

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:30.000
That one...?

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:36.450
What'll we do for the second battle, partner?

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.000
How do you wanna run?

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:45.210
It circled in the stadium with insane speed.

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:49.720
It hits the opponent out and 
then continues attacking.

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:55.320
But if I know it's coming, I can counter it!

00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:58.940
Second battle!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:05.240
It looks like Valt Aoi has a new technique!

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:11.230
Will he win? Or will Hoji win yet again!?

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:14.530
Here's the Second Battle we've waited for!

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:18.480
I'll give him the most power I can muster up.

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:22.570
He's changed his grip again!

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:24.400
A backhand grip!

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:27.210
He's gonna use it to get more speed!

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:29.210
Ready, set!

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:31.210
Partner, I trust you!

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:33.550
Three!

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:34.930
Two!

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.300
One!

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:39.060
Go Shoot!

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:44.890
Hoji Konda pulls the Long Winder with a strong twist!

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:48.290
Wh-What's this!? It's circling the stadium!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:50.280
He's trying to catch him off guard!

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:54.060
And Valt himself is using... a Rush Shoot!?

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:56.610
Another Rush Shoot!

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:57.740
What!?

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:02.200
Not a Flash Shoot!?

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:07.970
Look at that, Horusood was supposed to 
be in the path of Valykrie's Rush Shoot!

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:12.250
Hoji Konda completely outplayed him! 
Valkyrie keeps missing!

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:13.460
Seriously?

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:14.210
No way!

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:15.640
It's over.

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:17.030
Are you sure?

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.280
What?

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.720
Look at Hoji.

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:23.680
I misread him...

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:26.980
You won't get away! Go, Valkyrie!

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:32.390
Valkyrie's using the slant of the stadium to gain speed!

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:35.100
And now, here it comes...

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:37.150
It'll hit Horusood!

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:42.550
Valkyrie's gonna hit Horusood!

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:44.860
Horusood Field!

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:59.180
Go, Valkyrie!

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:07.240
Destroy him!

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:29.740
Horusood is knocked into the air!

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:29.570
-What!?

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:32.380
It managed to recover!

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:35.450
This is the real fight! Keep it together!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:38.880
Horusood is heading to its best area to fight!

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:40.340
I won't let you!

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:44.760
Valkyrie is stopping Horusood 
from returning to the center!

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:46.970
Get him, Valkyrie!

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:51.780
Horusood can't make it back to 
the center thanks to Valkyrie!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.060
Valkyrie keeps on going!

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:59.750
Thanks to the downhill slope, 
its speed keeps increasing!

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:03.280
Great, Valt!

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:04.530
Get him!

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:06.850
Its keeps getting faster.

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:08.540
This is the Rush Shoot!

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:14.250
Horusood tries to go back to the center, 
but Valkyrie hits it from above!

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:16.660
Horusood heads back to the center again!

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:18.610
Send him flying, Horusood!

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:22.950
Pierce through, Valkyrie!

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:30.980
Holy Horusood burst!

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:40.970
Victory Valkyrie, Burst Finish!

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.610
2-1, Valt Aoi wins!

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:49.910
I did it!

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:51.670
He won, he won!

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:54.370
Valt had me worried for a bit there!

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:57.120
A comeback with a Burst Finish.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:59.130
He barely won, like always.

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.690
What happened?

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:03.580
Valkyrie, huh?

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:05.640
He played quite the song.

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:08.820
That was obviously a fluke!

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:09.990
Are you sure?

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:10.700
What?

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:14.380
Konda thought he'd do a Flash Shoot,

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:16.710
and so he made Horusood run on the sides.

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:20.400
But then Valt used a Rush Shoot.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.820
No, he believed in a Rush Shoot.

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:28.340
Thanks to that, the Rush Shoot 
gained even more speed,

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:32.060
and burst Horusood with a powerful counter.

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:36.450
Amazing! Amazing! So that's what happened?

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:39.820
He won thanks to his split-second decision.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.010
I'm sorry,

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:45.040
Horusood.

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:48.300
Partner, I believed in you!

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:56.310
Heading to the A-Block 
semifinals now is... Valt Aoi!

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:06.320
Congrats, Valt.

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:12.480
Thanks!

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.950
Just tell me one thing.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:19.460
Why didn't you use your new technique?

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:22.580
Uh, why...?

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:28.740
Well, I wasn't thinking at all!

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:33.450
It's just that I felt like Valkyrie 
wanted to do a Rush Shoot!

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:37.750
You weren't thinking...?

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:48.250
I lost, but I still feel pretty good about it.

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:50.160
Mind battling me again soon?

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:53.910
Of course! Any time!

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:58.870
Valt...

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:02.660
Hoji lost to an idiot that didn't even think.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:05.350
That Valt idiot's gettin' interesting.

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:08.560
Wakiya, you're up soon.

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:09.860
I know.

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:13.070
Shu Kurenai!

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:17.140
Watch my next match real close, ya hear!?

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:23.400
Next battle's in B-Block!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:26.000
Next up in the fourth round,

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:29.340
The Lucky Seven, Haruto Aota!

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:30.000
-Lucky!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.990
I'll win for sure!

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:35.750
And now, one of the favorites to win...

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:39.990
Wakiya Komurasaki!

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:44.850
He hasn't even let anyone get a single point off of him!

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:47.370
Of course.

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:50.300
I'd rather be facing my sparring partner, though.

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:52.300
Don't mess with me!

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:55.420
I'll rip your little Wyvern bey to shreds!

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:59.540
Look at you! You're just like that Valt guy!

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:01.270
I'm Haruto!

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:04.160
-Even your names sound the same!

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:04.160
-Hey, Shu, I'm not like him, am I?

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:06.770
I'm gonna win for sure!

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:11.240
He's right! This Aota guy is just like Bro!

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.210
Yeah, it is!

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:14.780
He's just as dumb, too!

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:17.460
His Bey's an Attack Type, too.

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:19.290
Just like Valt's.

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:22.520
Wild Wyvern is a Defense Type.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:25.900
In other words, it beats Attack Types.

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:29.860
I can't get excited over a battle I know I'll win.

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:31.480
What!?

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:34.820
Oh yeah, there's tons of people watching.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:37.830
I've gotta show off how good I am.

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:40.470
I'll finish ya quick, okay?

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:42.360
First Battle!

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:50.320
Now, what kind of battle is 
Wakiya Komurasaki going to show us!?

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:54.530
Blink and you'll miss it, everyone!

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:56.620
Ready, set!

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:58.030
Three!

00:17:58.800 --> 00:17:59.540
Two!

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:00.910
One!

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:03.580
Go Shoot!

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:09.820
Wild Wyvern, shot with amazing accuracy,

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:12.300
takes the center of the stadium!

00:18:13.260 --> 00:18:15.880
This is my Shield Shoot.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:21.020
Shield Shoot?

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.780
It's stopped in the center!

00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:28.440
It didn't stop.

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:32.190
It's spinning so fast it looks like it stopped.

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:35.860
A move you can only use if you're accurate.

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:39.620
All right! Attack me any time.

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:43.620
Haruto Aota is thinking now. 
Will he get lucky?

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:47.720
There's no openings. But I've gotta try!

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:48.880
Get him!

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:51.210
He's started attacking!

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:53.840
Wh-!?

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:57.690
But they aren't working on Wyvern!

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:01.600
With its eight-edged layer, the Vertical Disk negates attacks,

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:04.100
and the Orbit Driver reduces the impact!

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:05.580
He's not lucky at all!

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:07.050
So cool!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:10.000
This is Wyvern's power.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.520
Look closely, now.

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:16.190
You can at least be happy that 
you were able to even face me.

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:19.540
Shu, look!

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:22.200
Your Spriggan will end up like this.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:23.950
Go!

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:29.760
It's over with a Burst!

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:33.350
Wild Wyvern is spinning as fast as when it started!

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:37.930
Wakiya Komurasaki once again 
gets a burst in the first battle!

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:42.050
He heads to the semifinals without 
losing a single point so far!

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:44.060
Did ya all have fun?

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:46.810
Wasn't too fun for me, though!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:53.320
Komurasaki has gotten even 
stronger since last year.

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:55.410
He's good!

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:56.420
Hey, Valt!

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:00.990
Don't go admiring him! 
He's your next opponent!

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:02.070
Really?

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:04.450
Did you not realize?

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:08.660
He's my next opponent.

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:13.360
Bro, can you beat the Shield Shoot?

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:14.840
I've got to!

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:17.340
That's our big brother!

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:22.420
To get to have an awesome 
battle like that is amazing!

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:24.070
Valkyrie!

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:27.930
Our next opponent is insanely strong!

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:30.660
It just makes me even more pumped!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.360
You little...

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:36.720
Wakiya's battle was amazing as usual!

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:37.780
Yeah!

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:40.910
Young Master really does stand at the top.

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:45.200
Wakiya and Valt.

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:48.040
Those two play a good tune.

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.260
It was crazy, Mom!

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:55.420
That Wakiya guy is awesome!

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:59.210
He blocked every attack with his Shield Shoot!

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:02.010
I get it already, so don't stop working!

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:04.140
Kneading dough is training, too!

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:06.990
Right, I forgot!

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:11.270
You've only been talking about Wakiya!

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:14.010
But how was your match, Valt?

00:21:14.110 --> 00:21:19.210
How can... I win... against... the Shield Shoot?

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.190
Valt?

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:22.990
Valt! How was your match!?

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:27.540
Bro won.

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:29.730
He won the fourth round.

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:31.060
Barely, though!

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:33.670
Valt, good job!

00:21:33.670 --> 00:21:36.900
My Rush Shoot should do the trick.

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:38.670
-Good job, Valt!

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:38.670
-It'll work...

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:40.380
Rush...

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:41.880
Shoot!

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:49.960
Rush Shoot!

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:57.190
Hey!

00:21:57.350 --> 00:22:00.110
Valt! Get to work!

00:22:01.490 --> 00:22:04.070
I'm sorry, Mom!

00:22:19.240 --> 00:22:25.590
<i>With huge hopes stuffed in my bag</i>

00:22:19.240 --> 00:22:25.590
<i>ookina kibou wo baggu ni tsumekonde</i>

00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:32.080
<i>The train set off towards the future</i>

00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:32.080
<i>ressha wa mirai e ima hashiri dashita</i>

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:37.680
<i>Holding the ticket to my dreams close</i>

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:37.680
<i>yume no kippu wo gyutto nigirishimete</i>

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:46.840
<i>I move forward, without a doubt in my mind</i>

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:46.840
<i>osorezu ni susumu mou keshite mayowanai kara</i>

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:51.280
<i>On these long and winding rails</i>

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:51.280
<i>hatenaku tsuzuku nagai reeru</i>

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:54.440
<i>Where you get off is up to you</i>

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:54.440
<i>shuuchakuten wa jibun de kimeru</i>

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:56.750
<i>Chase it, chase it</i>

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:56.750
<i>oikakete oikakete</i>

00:22:56.790 --> 00:23:01.010
<i>I know your dreams will come true some day</i>

00:22:56.790 --> 00:23:01.010
<i>mieru keshiki ga aru to boku wa shinjiteru</i>

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:06.750
<i>Run, keep running, run far</i>

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:06.750
<i>hashitte hashiri tsuzukete, kakenukeru</i>

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:10.880
<i>Get past the countless tears</i>

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:10.880
<i>ikutsumo no namida o koete</i>

00:23:10.970 --> 00:23:13.860
<i>so we can be stronger</i>

00:23:10.970 --> 00:23:13.860
<i>bokura wa tsuyoku naru</i>

00:23:14.040 --> 00:23:19.590
<i>Some day we'll get glory, so until then</i>

00:23:14.040 --> 00:23:19.590
<i>itsuka eikou o tsukamu sono hi made</i>

00:23:19.770 --> 00:23:23.150
<i>Turn your dreams into reality</i>

00:23:19.770 --> 00:23:23.150
<i>yume wa yume no mama janai</i>

00:23:23.410 --> 00:23:27.500
<i>Our endless adventure continues</i>

00:23:23.410 --> 00:23:27.500
<i>owarinai tabi wa tsuzuku</i>

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:38.870
Wakiya's place is huge!

00:23:38.870 --> 00:23:40.950
It's got the latest equipment,

00:23:40.950 --> 00:23:43.380
and he trains his Bey every day in there!

00:23:43.380 --> 00:23:46.900
What!? Wakiya's got a new move!?

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:48.410
Awesome!

00:23:48.410 --> 00:23:49.820
Let's battle, Wakiya!

00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:52.200
I'll take your new technique on!

00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:56.080
Next time on Beyblade Burst: 
"Wyvern in the Way!!"

00:23:56.240 --> 00:23:58.050
Three, two, one...

00:23:58.450 --> 00:23:59.950
Go Shoot!
